# Build context is the repo root — exclude everything not needed for the sib Docker build.

# Dependencies (reinstalled inside the image)
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# TypeScript compiled output (rebuilt inside the image)
dist/
**/dist/

# SIB local data (never baked into the image; lives on the Render disk at runtime)
**/.sib-data/

# iOS app — not part of the server build
ios-app/

# AR client — not part of the server build
ar-client/src/
ar-client/public/

# Docs and config files not needed at runtime
docs/
skills/
*.md
# …except the docs the server SERVES at runtime (each needs a re-include or the
# image build fails with "not found" — learned the hard way with the wireframe):
#   /mindmap/glossary + /catalog term definitions → docs/roadmap-glossary.md
#   /catalog/doc/:id spec deep-dives             → all top-level docs/*.md
#   /catalog/data                                → docs/catalog/*.md
#   /wireframe                                   → docs/APP-WIREFRAME.html
#   /catalog/doc/:id specs pointing at ../README.md → root README.md
!docs/*.md
!docs/catalog/*.md
!docs/APP-WIREFRAME.html
!README.md
.git/
.gitignore

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
